    "headline": "Flood Advisory issued October 7 at 4:18PM EDT until October 7 at 6:15PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL",
    "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.\n\n* WHERE...Southern Brevard County in east central Florida...\n\n* WHEN...Until 615 PM EDT.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 418 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated heavy rain. Minor flooding\nis ongoing or expected to begin shortly in the advisory area.\nBetween 1 and 2 inches of rai",
    "instruction": "Turn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood\ndeaths occur in vehicles.\n\nBe aware of your surroundings and do not drive on flooded roads.",
